    "participationBody": "Any driver finishing outside the top 7 still earns <strong>1 point</strong> for completing the race. DNS/DNF results yield no points.",
    "dropTitle": "Drop round",
    "dropBody": "To account for absences, any driver who has started at least two races discards their single lowest-scoring result. If you only have one start it always counts. When a driver skips a scheduled race (for example, in a three-race round where they only started two events), that non-raced round is what gets dropped so the finishes they do have are preserved. The dropped race still appears in the standings breakdown with a red strikethrough so everyone can audit totals.",
