    "tieBestBody": "If wins are equal, we compare the single best finishing position across the season (1st beats 2nd, etc.).",
    "tieFirstTitle": "First to Achieve Best Finish",
    "tieFirstBody": "If wins and best results still match, the driver who recorded that top finish earlier in the season ranks ahead.",
    "tieAlphaTitle": "Alphabetical Order",
    "tieAlphaBody": "When every metric\u2014including timing of the best finish\u2014remains identical, we fall back to the driver name (alphabetical) to keep the table deterministic.",
    "tieNote": "These rules mirror how the site currently sorts standings, so what you see on the scoreboard always reflects this logic."
